OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket badly damaged as
OL,4,Athieves rip cash machine from wall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have ripped a cash machine out
OL,7,Fof the wall of a supermarket near
OL,8,FStirling, leaving the building badly
OL,9,Fdamaged.
OL,11,FPolice were alerted to the theft at the
OL,12,FCo-op in Doune at about 03:30 and later
OL,13,Ffound the ATM in a pick-up truck at a
OL,14,Fpremises off the B826.
OL,16,FPart of the shop's wall has collapsed,
OL,17,Fleaving the inside completely exposed
OL,18,Fand the pavement strewn with debris.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
